@startuml
title Digital Watch UML State Machine Diagram

state Start
state TimeView
state AdjustTime
state AlarmOnOff
state AlarmRing
state AlarmStop
state LightOnOff

[*]Start --> TimeView: View Time
TimeView --> AdjustTime: Adjust Hour, Minutes, Alarm Hour, Alarm Minutes
AdjustTime --> AdjustTime: Increase Values
AlarmOnOff --> AlarmOnOff: Turn On/Off Alarm
AlarmOnOff --> TimeView: Alarm Off
AlarmRing --> AlarmStop: Ring Alarm
AlarmStop --> LightOnOff: Stop Alarm
LightOnOff --> LightOnOff: Turn Off Light
LightOnOff --> Start: Light Off

title Online College Magazine System UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice
state Login
state Admin
state User
state ArticleCreation
state Editing
state Publication
state Searching
state Feedback

[*]StartChoice --> Login: Create Account or Log In
Login --> Admin: Admin Access
Admin --> AdminChoice: Add, Edit, Remove User Profiles
Admin --> EditorChoice: Review Articles
EditorChoice --> Editing: Edit Articles
Editing --> Publication: Pass for Approval
Publication --> Searching: Make Available for Reading
Searching --> Feedback: Provide Feedback
Feedback --> ReadFeedbackChoice: End Session

title Smart Traffic Management System UML State Machine Diagram

state Start
state MonitorTraffic
state ControlStreetLights
state ManageSignals
state CheckViolation
state FineIssued
state FinePaid
state WarningSent

[*]Start --> MonitorTraffic: Monitor Traffic Conditions
MonitorTraffic --> ControlStreetLights: Adjust Street Lights
ControlStreetLights --> ManageSignals: Manage Traffic Signals
ManageSignals --> CheckViolation: Capture Vehicle Numbers, Check Driver Details
CheckViolation --> FineIssued: Issue Fine if Rule Broken
FineIssued --> FinePaid: Fine Paid
FineIssued --> WarningSent: Send Warning if Fine Not Paid

title Online Marketplace UML State Machine Diagram

state Start
state Registration
state SignIn
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state Browsing
state ShoppingCart

[*]Start --> Registration: Register as Seller or Customer
Registration --> SignIn: Complete Registration and Verification
SignIn --> SellerWorkspace: Seller Access
SellerWorkspace --> ProductAddition: Add New Products
SellerWorkspace --> ProductPromotion: Promote Existing Products
SellerWorkspace --> SignIn: Log Out
SignIn --> CustomerDashboard: Customer Access
CustomerDashboard --> Browsing: Explore Products
Browsing --> ShoppingCart: Proceed with Purchase or Stop Browsing
@enduml
